                    "reading": "Gaau3 sau6 hai2 hok6 seut6 yin4 tou2 wui6 seung6 min6 heung3 hok6 saang1 cheung4 sai3 gong2 gaai2.",
                    "translation": "The professor explained the core grammatical rules and practical examples of '興趣、運動同娛樂 (Hobbies & Recreation)' in detail to students at the seminar."
