                    "reading": "Hai2 gwok3 jai3 hok6 seut6 daai6 wui6 seung6 min6, gok3 gwok3 doi6 biu2 jin2 hoi1 liu5 gaau1 lau4.",
                    "translation": "At the international academic conference, delegates from various countries conducted extensive exchanges on linguistics."
